        "Local core is built; AX ran on a cluster in run 3 (6 PASS, 3 FAIL); Salesforce is BLOCKED."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Rules the layers keep",
      "items": [
        "Identity comes from the verified installation, never from message text.",
        "Every effect, slack.reply included, is a C3 envelope that policy decided.",
        "A worker's 'done' reply is one observation for the collector, not the verdict.",
        "A fact the collector could not read is absent with a reason, so the status is UNKNOWN, not 0."
      ]
    },
